			"notes": "New Item Delta feature, with some tweaks, and bug fixes.\n\n## New\n* Added an Item Delta feature. Now you can see how many items are going into or out of a container per second.\n* Added settings relating to the new feature.\n* Double chests now combine together.\n\n## Changes\n* Changed the default values of some settings.\n* Increased the max value of Scan Radius to 64.\n* Increase the max value of Outline Thickness to 6.\n* Reduced the min for Scan Radius to 2.\n* Increased color gradient maxes to accommodate double chests.\n\n## Fixes\n* Fixed a bug with custom gradient color amounts.\n* Fixed a bug where the client could spam requests.\n* Fixed some typos in the settings."
		},
